   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Dataform API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Repositories, workspaces, release configs and workflow configs are configuration metadata: no Git repository, file, commit, remote, npm package or BigQuery job exists. Compilation and invocation never happen: cron schedules never fire, compilation results and workflow invocations are unimplemented, and release compilation results are refused. Folders and the input-only admin grant are refused; a repository with workspaces, release configs or workflow configs cannot be deleted, as in Dataform, even with force=true.",
